a clark county school district teacher  receives a big honor  the choir director at green valley high  school is a semi-finalist for the 2021  grammy music  educator award 8 news 9 reporter kristen  drummond joins us live in the newsroom  now with more  on this national recognition kristen  sasha there were nearly 2  000 nominations submitted from all 50  states the recording academy and grammy  museum dwindled the list  down to 25 semi-finalists one of those  music teachers is from las vegas and get  this the only educator from nevada  up for this national award i'm just  honored  to have gone this far kim ritzer hits a  high note  in her career it was nominated for the  music educator grammy that is put  out by the grammy association a welcome  surprise for the choir director at green  valley high school the national award  recognizes teachers making a significant  and  lasting contribution to music education  while demonstrating a commitment to  keeping music education in schools  i do what i do because i love it i've  always wanted to teach choir that's  all i've ever wanted to do ritzer has  been teaching music for 31 years in the  clark county school district this is  what i see on my side  the pandemic made it her first  experience though only teaching online  we're still singing in a different way  but we're still singing and making music  adjusting to distance education while  continuing to build the choir program  known to perform around the country  we've sung at carnegie hall  and even saying back up for the rock and  roll band the rolling stones in 2013  during a concert in las vegas  here is ritzer with her class at a  rehearsal before the big day  [Music]  but her lessons and passion for music  education go beyond the classroom  she's shown thousands of students how to  find their voice and use it to make the  world a better place her principal and  student submitted testimonials hard work  kindness  bravery and enthusiasm are just a few of  the qualities  which mrs ritzer exudes on a daily basis  and helps to instill in all of us  all praise her ability to inspire the  next generation of singers  complimenting her dedication to keep the  music playing  even during challenging circumstances  just so you know  i can see everybody i've built a program  there that i'm very very proud of  ten finalists will be named next month  and a winner will be highlighted during  the 2021 grammy week events  along with receiving a ten thousand  dollar cash prize  and matching grant for their school's  program so our fingers are crossed for  her  sasha
 

